  models/fr3_fric_v1.xml (derived from Menagerie's fr3.xml; the original is in archive/models_old_variants/) and the meshes in models/assets come from Menagerie
  (per the CRISP docs), modified by the CRISP authors (torque actuators, joint friction) and
  later by this project (friction/damping/armature).

The Menagerie license file (Apache-2.0 plus a Willow Garage BSD section, copied verbatim from
https://github.com/google-deepmind/mujoco_menagerie/blob/main/franka_fr3/LICENSE) is shipped next to the model:
models/LICENSE.

The six whole-link visual meshes link0.obj and link3.obj to link7.obj were removed from models/assets (unused duplicates of the split pieces).
models/fr3_fric_v1.xml includes the Franka Hand using mass, inertia and geometry from franka_description (Apache-2.0).

models/assets holds only mesh files (35 .obj and 9 .stl) from the same Menagerie franka_fr3 folder; they are covered by models/LICENSE.
